```matlab
function result = diagOffDiagProductSum(A, B)
    n = size(A, 1);
    sumResult = 0;
    for i = 1:n
        for j = 1:n
            if i == j
                sumResult = sumResult + A(i,i) * B(i,j+1);
            else
                sumResult = sumResult + A(i,j) * B(i,j);
            end
        end
    end
    result = sumResult;
end
```
